{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n スナック眞緒開店前の様子〜\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHG7ZWD8ET1D7H4TW9C5TCV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHG80V6THKP6SVJD6VGFJK2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n ねえまなも〜\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHG81XJV18CAE73FFJ9CYXW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n あっそうそう！\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHG82ZD15FDG80NXNX0H2C1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n よっこらせっと\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHG840B144PN7G38JM4CCM2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 開店前の景気付けに\n 一杯ひっかけときましょう〜\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHG850J311CVAQ9QA0D325J","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n はい乾杯〜🥂✨\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHG865CJRXX9Y8DXVFJWE2N","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 最高〜💕💕\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHG876DS4WFBSM4TM0432AE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n あら？まなも\n ちょっとまた可愛くなったんじゃない？\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHG885J4HGZNH10969KHY48","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n えっわかります？\n やっぱりママわかっちゃいます？\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHG8969M18GQJDR50GEQWB7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n さすがママだな〜\n やっぱりママは隅に置けないな〜\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHG8A5FM2GH4Y21JZKTDKW3","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n まっ\n 夜は長いしゆっくり飲みながら\n お話ししましょ〜\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHG8B55C89847859NY0CN8B","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n そうね\n 今夜はお客さんの前で\n ゆっくりじっくり\n 聞かせてもらうわね\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHG8C3YESVCV988WWKWRJFA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n んふふふふ\n はーい\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHG8D4WVSW11ZJ5H72HVMY7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n じゃあ今日も頑張りましょう\n 乾杯〜🥂💕く〜"}],"source":"archive"}